  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi SDG Acceleration Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Malawi SDG Acceleration Fund is a vehicle for pooled resources by development partners to tackle strategic challenges for SDG achievement in Malawi. The Fund supports the coherent resource mobilization, allocation and disbursement of donor resources to under-funded cross sectoral areas where the UN has a comparative advantage in implementing together.</narrative>
  </description>
